  Content: 'Emergency care specialists who specialize in providing medical care in
    the field.


    While the introduction of Typocrypha and healing Spells has improved medic efficacy,
    modern healing Spells lack the ability to fully heal heavy trauma. As such, medics
    within AEIOU are still expected to have practical medical training.'
